 Current selected patch:
 
 - `MMVQ` RDNA3.5 warp tuning in `ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmvq.cu`.
-- `FA` RDNA3.5 K64 override in `ggml/src/ggml-cuda/fattn-tile.cuh`.
